.DS_Store
# Per-machine, never committed: miserc.local.toml (the declared environment),
# config.local.toml ([vars]), and a pod's .pinned-commit (home-ops writes it).
*.local.toml
!*.local.toml.example
__pycache__/
# mise writes lock sidecars to locks/ again (2026.10.23; the .mise/locks layout
# only existed in 2026.10.20–.22). Ignore stray mise state under .mise/, if any.
.mise/
.pinned-commit
